<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: OFT to consider CRH buy of BTR unit.</title>
<headline>OFT to consider CRH buy of BTR unit.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The director general of the UK Office of Fair Trading said on Wednesday he was considering whether CRH's acquisition of BTR's Tilcon qualified for investigation under the provisions of the Fair Trading Act.</p>
<p>If the deal is found to qualify, it will be further considered with a view to advising whether the merger should be referred to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission for investigation and report.</p>
<p>Representations about the implications for competition and other aspects of the public interest should be made in writing by November 6, the OFT said in a statement.</p>
<p>BTR sold Tilcon to CRH in September for $329 million.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
